ai-transit.v1 standalone read-only service

Derived from the Sub2API code in this repository (upstream Wei-Shaw/sub2api).
The original project license is retained verbatim in LICENSE.
Public protocol DTOs, channel model catalog/pricing conversion, pricing alias
lookup and monitor health scoring were extracted from the existing source.
The bundled model price catalog is the existing Sub2API-distributed
model_prices_and_context_window.json (LiteLLM-format pricing data), preserved
without an online downloader. Its values are a versioned local snapshot,
not a promise of current provider pricing. See git history for provenance.

Extraction baseline: ec9bd05b652d393d017ccca00b0b67d9c7ca0c72.
Upstream compatibility starts at Sub2API v0.2.8
(fd80b08c90b55edcad5b00171b53f08721d30da1). Pure group allowlist matching
and its model alias helpers derive from that tag; existing pure pricing
helpers are reused. No upstream account, routing or gateway services are included.
See docs/sub2api-compatibility.md for source paths and schema compatibility.
